      'INDYCAR is a mostly American series that is SPEC or control formula every team uses the SAME Dallara chassis and one of two engine suppliers Chevrolet or Honda about 700 horsepower 2.2 litre twin turbo V6 so the cars are far more equal and cheaper it races on a MIX of superspeedway ovals short ovals road courses and street circuits the Indianapolis 500 is its crown jewel',
